<title>MALAYSIA: India's STC seeks to buy 6,000t palm oil -traders.</title>
<headline>India's STC seeks to buy 6,000t palm oil -traders.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's STC is seeking to buy on Tuesday 6,000 tonnes of RBD palm olein for October 5-20 shipment, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-2308911)</p>
